ak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見切れてる純奈じわる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部がお父さんお母さんとお出かけした時に買ったお洋服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/12/11/5707649/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リボンはひめちゃんに借りました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/12/11/5707649/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈にとってもらってたら\n純奈が全力で邪魔してきた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会を重ねていくごとに\n会いに来てくれる方が増えてきて\nとっても嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都と名古屋の3部も完売したと聞きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちの会場でも、サンタさんかトナカイさんか何かやるので\n楽しみにしていてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんなのだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/12/11/5707649/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛伸びたという報告"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、10枚目シングルの特典で\n名古屋でミニライブと似顔絵会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会は、応募して当選された方\n5名の方がきてくれました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前より上手くなってるかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の似顔絵会の時のために、\n帽子とか眼鏡とかそういう絵もかけるように、頑張ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜メンバーとアンダーメンバーと研究生のごちゃまぜで\nチーム東日本メンバーとして\n何度目の青空か?、転がった鐘をならせ!、遠回りの愛情、あの日僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた、私、起きる。、走れ!Bicycle、制服のマネキン、おいでシャンプー、ガールズルールを披露しました٩(◦`꒳´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ!Bicycleでは、塩アイスの3人で\n初の1列目をやらせてもらえました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶然、みんな1列目で\n嬉しかったな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、となりで純奈がにこにこして\n踊ってるんだも～ん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か?では、みさ先輩ポジ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"転がった鐘をならせ!、走れ!Bicycleが、玲香さんポジ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンが、市來さんポジ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠回りの愛情が、能條さんポジ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルールが、真夏さんポジ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーが、岩瀬さんポジ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、起きる.。とぼくうそは、自分のポジションでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"転がった鐘をならせ!が、楽しくてしょうがない♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/12/11/5707649/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEの時の髪型は、編み込みでまとめたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他になにかあったかなー？\n毎日いろいろあるから、忘れちゃうよ～、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！のぎ天見てくれましたか？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"研究生も交じってアンダーライブメンバーで、アスレチック対決しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は水上コースと二期生対決の空中対決に参加したよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスはへたっぴだけど、意外と動けます٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回は釣りサークル第2だん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/12/11/5707649/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"釣りサークルメンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告のまりかさんの\nまた北野だ～って言った時の顔が可愛かった٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も釣りサークルの部長に、強気発言しているので見てね٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくは言えないから、放送されてからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。あと、のぎ天毎回うるさくてごめんなさい。楽しくてしょうがないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、11月お誕生日の方！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/12/11/5707649/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/12/11/5707649/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"